---
title: 妖狐は占い師に占われると死亡し cause=fox_kill が記録される (die-when-divined trait)
setup: { seer: 1, werehamster: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 1 }
rules:
  first-victim: none
---
# 0夜 に Alice (占) が Bob (狐) を占い → engine は die-when-divined trait を
# 検出して Bob を kill + fox_kill event を emit。
# Day 1 投票で Carol (狼) 処刑 → 狼全滅 + 狐死亡 → villager_won。
# 検証: Bob の最終 status:dead と死因 (events 経由) が fox_kill。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=占い師
!Bob=妖狐
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人
!Alice 0夜 占い Bob

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# fox_kill (divine curse): Bob
# == end ==

Alice→Carol
Dave→Carol
Carol→Alice

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Carol 2 / Alice 1 → execution=Carol
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: villager_won
# survivors: Alice, Dave
# == end ==

# @expect-status Bob: dead
# @expect-cause Bob: fox_kill
